# Library Management System

## Project Description
The Library Management System is a software application developed to manage library operations efficiently. It helps librarians and students manage books, issue and return records, and maintain student details digitally.

---

## Features
- User Login System
- Add New Books
- Update Book Details
- Delete Books
- Search Books
- Issue Books
- Return Books
- Student Record Management
- Fine Calculation
- Database Storage

---

## Technologies Used
### Frontend
- HTML
- CSS
- JavaScript

### Backend
- PHP / Java

### Database
- MySQL

